<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Contact Mosvera</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Public contact links for Mosvera." />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://mosvera.io/contact" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page-shell text-page">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <img src="/brand/mark.svg" alt="" width="34" height="34" />
        <span>Mosvera</span>
      </a>
      <section class="text-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
        <h1>Public project channels.</h1>
        <p>
          Mosvera is an open-source project. For product questions, bugs, and
          implementation discussion, use the relevant GitHub repository.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/mosvera/spec/issues">Specification issues</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/mosvera/runtime/issues">TypeScript runtime issues</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/mosvera/python/issues">Python runtime issues</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/mosvera/mcp/issues">MCP issues</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/mosvera/providers/issues">Provider adapter issues</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          For security vulnerabilities, use <a href="/security">the security policy</a>
          instead of a public issue.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
